# Git change control

Protect pre-existing dirty work. Use a dedicated branch/worktree from fetched `origin/main` for authority or shared edits. Stage only intended files. Reject secrets, databases, model binaries, and unrelated dirty paths.

Merge only the exact reviewed head when required checks pass and policy allows. Never merge an older green head. Never force-push. After merge, fetch `origin/main` and reconcile accepted files into `C:\Genesis_System3_Clean` without reset.

Local HEAD may differ from `origin/main`; report both.
